[TITLE]
FILE-16: one [PIPES], one [PUMPS] and one [VALVES] line with too few fields
Each short line has a complete twin (P1, PU1, V1) in parallel, so the network still
solves without it.

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   0     500
 J2   0     500
 J3   0     0
 J4   0     500

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   100
 R2   0
 R3   100

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  R1                                         ; end node missing
 P3  R3  J3  1000    12    100    0      Open

[PUMPS]
;ID   N1  N2  Parameters
 PU1  R2  J2  HEAD C1
 PU2  R2                                        ; end node missing

[VALVES]
